#ad Come hike with me as we venture through some new trails and check out what my new backyard has to offer. But don’t forget to pack the essentials: water and SNACKS! 

I recently got hooked on Snyder’s of Hanover® Pretzel Pieces. They are a hike-friendly snack that is easy to pack in your bag. Getting back out in nature has been a goal of mine this summer and walking the trails seems like just that. It allows me to escape and reconnect with my own peaceful rhythm. It’s in these moments you truly feel alive and discover new strength.

