Nothing beats the joy of exploring the beauty of our diverse world with my girls by my side. 

@filipajackson and I firmly believe that the best classroom is at the feet of the world itself, where different places and cultures narrate their own unique stories. 

We're thrilled to announce that we are getting ready to pack our bags again! Adventure is calling and we must go. Can't wait to make more memories and broaden our horizons. Stay tuned!
